id: searx-ci-modernization
title: Modernize GitHub Actions and supported CI runtimes
description: "Upgrade action majors and Node test runtimes, preserve Bun/npm parity, and eliminate runner deprecation warnings."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: ci,dependencies,github-actions,node
created_at: "2026-07-16T16:58:05.040Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-16T17:40:01.708Z"
deadline: "2026-07-19T16:58:05.040Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-16T17:40:01.685Z"
author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: All required workflow jobs pass without Node 20 action deprecation warnings; Bun and npm install/build/test/package surfaces remain green
definition_of_ready: Current workflow inventory and deprecation logs captured.
parent: searx-recovery-plan
risk: medium
confidence: 90
sprint: 2026-07-recovery
release: next
resolution: "Pinned Gitleaks Action v3 at e0c47f4f8be36e29cdc102c57e68cb5cbf0e8d1e, eliminating the final Node 20 action runtime."
expected_result: Required workflow jobs pass without retired action runtimes while Bun and npm surfaces remain green.
actual_result: "Gitleaks v3 executes on Node 24; both exact-head workflow runs pass with zero annotations, alongside green CI and CodeQL."
