comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:05.040Z",codex-root,Current Actions logs warn checkout v4 and setup-node v4 use the retired Node 20 action runtime.
  "2026-07-16T17:04:15.804Z",codex-root,"Updated checkout v6 across workflows, setup-node v6 with Node 22.12 minimum and Node 24 current coverage, semantic-pull-request v6, and action-gh-release v3. Preserved required job names. Local lint/build/frozen Bun/npm install and audit checks pass; final closure awaits GitHub execution."
  "2026-07-16T17:25:29.375Z",codex-root,Consolidated workflow modernization is published in PR 31; waiting for required hosted checks on the final evidence-bearing head.
  "2026-07-16T17:29:27.958Z",codex-root,"Hosted exact-head proof on 095aa8591fa5aebf151a00b584c3cf330a0d40de: quality-bun, quality-node, package-smoke, Gitleaks, CodeQL analyze, and semantic PR title all pass."
  "2026-07-16T17:37:03.828Z",codex-root,"Default-branch secret scan run 29520307741 passed but emitted a Node 20 action-runtime deprecation annotation for gitleaks/gitleaks-action@v2. Upgrade the pinned action to v3, which declares node24, and require annotation-free hosted proof before closing again."
  "2026-07-16T17:40:00.988Z",codex-root,"Exact PR 33 head 20071d4645211b51a340248cf0b679beec963e2b passed both Gitleaks workflow executions (runs 29520566663 and 29520568278) with empty annotation arrays. CI Bun/Node/package smoke, CodeQL, semantic title, CodeRabbit, and Sourcery are also green; no inline review comments exist."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:05.040Z",codex-root,Keep branch-protection job names stable while modernizing internals.
learnings[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-16T16:58:05.040Z",codex-root,CodeQL failures on stale bot PRs are configuration failures caused by frozen lock drift rather than findings.
  "2026-07-16T17:29:27.958Z",codex-root,Repository-wide SHA enforcement must be enabled only after the pinned pull_request_target workflow reaches the default branch; the base-branch v5 tag was otherwise blocked before merge.
  "2026-07-16T17:40:00.988Z",codex-root,"A passing workflow is insufficient evidence for action-runtime modernization: inspect check-run annotations because GitHub emits retired Node runtime warnings as non-failing annotations."
