close_reason: PR 33 exact head passes all hosted checks; both Gitleaks runs have zero annotations and the final Node 20 warning is eliminated.
body: "Update all first-party actions consistently across CI, CodeQL, secret scan, release, and PR-title workflows. Exercise supported Node versions and retain required check names."
